All records relating to environmental assessment of the works, including:
a. Any Environmental Impact Assessment (EIA) carried out in relation to the works;
b. Any EIA Screening Report, screening determination, or written decision that an EIA was not required;
c. Any records setting out the criteria, reasoning, or thresholds relied upon in determining that an EIA was or was not required;
d. Any correspondence with statutory bodies relating to EIA requirements.
2. Appropriate Assessment (AA)
All records relating to assessment under the EU Habitats Directive, including:
a. Any Appropriate Assessment (AA) Screening Report;
b. Any determination that the works would not have a significant effect on Natura 2000 sites;
c. Any ecological advice, reasoning, or documentation underpinning such determinations.
3. Ecological and Biodiversity Assessments
All ecological, environmental, or biodiversity-related records prepared, commissioned, or obtained prior to the works, including but not limited to:
a. Ecological walkover surveys;
b. Habitat assessments or habitat classifications;
c. Biodiversity impact assessments;
d. Assessments of impacts on biodiversity corridors or urban green infrastructure;
e. Breeding bird surveys or nesting risk assessments;
f. Pollinator assessments or surveys.
